    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd14 Add to your Wishlist and Play the free Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f A gentle, cozy platformer about friendship and fading light.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Lighting Lanterns</strong>, you\u2019ll guide three unlikely friends through a gentle, handcrafted world \u2014 from golden bamboo groves to autumn tea villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light magical lanterns to reveal hidden bridges, bouncing flowers, and drowsy creatures. Switch between characters to solve cozy puzzles and uncover a warm, storybook-style tale \u2014 told by a gentle narrator who walks every step beside you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 What makes Lighting Lanterns special?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Light to Reveal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lanterns awaken platforms, creatures, and entire paths \u2014 like painting warmth into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Cozy, Not Challenging</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just light puzzly moments, gentle exploration, and small acts of kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Three Playable Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between a hopeful tanuki, a cautious bird, and a playful spirit to navigate gentle puzzles together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf42 <strong>A Journey Full of Cozy Places</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lantern-lit islands to autumn-colored rooftops \u2014 explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Narrated Like a Storybook</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Thomas Was Alone</i>, your journey is guided by a warm narrator who brings heart to every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde1 <i>Lighting Lanterns</i> is a short, heartfelt escape \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perfect for players who love narrative gems, gentle platformers, and cozy moments of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Best enjoyed with a blanket and a cup of tea.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd14 Add to your Wishlist and Play the free Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f A gentle, cozy platformer about friendship and fading light.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Lighting Lanterns</strong>, you\u2019ll guide three unlikely friends through a gentle, handcrafted world \u2014 from golden bamboo groves to autumn tea villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light magical lanterns to reveal hidden bridges, bouncing flowers, and drowsy creatures. Switch between characters to solve cozy puzzles and uncover a warm, storybook-style tale \u2014 told by a gentle narrator who walks every step beside you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 What makes Lighting Lanterns special?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Light to Reveal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lanterns awaken platforms, creatures, and entire paths \u2014 like painting warmth into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Cozy, Not Challenging</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just light puzzly moments, gentle exploration, and small acts of kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Three Playable Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between a hopeful tanuki, a cautious bird, and a playful spirit to navigate gentle puzzles together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf42 <strong>A Journey Full of Cozy Places</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lantern-lit islands to autumn-colored rooftops \u2014 explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Narrated Like a Storybook</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Thomas Was Alone</i>, your journey is guided by a warm narrator who brings heart to every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde1 <i>Lighting Lanterns</i> is a short, heartfelt escape \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perfect for players who love narrative gems, gentle platformers, and cozy moments of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Best enjoyed with a blanket and a cup of tea.</strong></p>",
